{"2154270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pixel Starships 2", "steam_appid": 2154270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Starships 2</strong> is a starship building and battle game in an MMO universe. Featuring full ship customization, online fleets, exploration, programmable AI, detailed planning, micro-management, and complex battle tactics. The strategy mechanics are inspired by games such as FTL, Eve online, and Final Fantasy, and XCom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/128762addcd1d98eadaec0d63d5b1a4d.poster.avif?t=1781620388\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/128762addcd1d98eadaec0d63d5b1a4d.webm?t=1781620388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/128762addcd1d98eadaec0d63d5b1a4d.mp4?t=1781620388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in epic real-time or asynchronous battles in <i>Pixel Starships 2</i>, where you command your fully-customized starship in strategic PvP and PvE combat across the galaxy. Layout your crew, program advanced battle AI, and unleash devastating combos as you face off against players from around the world in intense tactical showdowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/73964f397df229f4c1807ddb1d335dd7.poster.avif?t=1781620388\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/73964f397df229f4c1807ddb1d335dd7.webm?t=1781620388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/73964f397df229f4c1807ddb1d335dd7.mp4?t=1781620388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Systems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to a new graphics engine, PSS2 introduces a number of new gameplay mechanics. Oxygen and door access is now available. Ensure your mission critical rooms are well connected. New weapons facilities such as the bomb launcher introduce a new layer of depth. Room placement is even more important with bonuses for optimal placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/410729d26b3139dd0afc235509819603.poster.avif?t=1781620388\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/410729d26b3139dd0afc235509819603.webm?t=1781620388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/410729d26b3139dd0afc235509819603.mp4?t=1781620388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Programmable</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The programmable AI system is back with improvements. New filtering conditions allow fine-grain control for AFK setup. At the same time new AI chip unlocking, Presets, Layouts, and Templates allow quick strategic changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/710e2dd6046d6af5f8b0f4b5529a16ff.poster.avif?t=1781620388\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/710e2dd6046d6af5f8b0f4b5529a16ff.webm?t=1781620388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/710e2dd6046d6af5f8b0f4b5529a16ff.mp4?t=1781620388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Market Economy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The economy in the game is entirely market driven. You can loot, mine, craft, and re-sell items and equipment. Take advantage of resources in specific regions to create rare items. Control lucrative planets and trade routes for maximum economic advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/5e5e9953ce9fc9889795bd4fb21d4488.poster.avif?t=1781620388\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/5e5e9953ce9fc9889795bd4fb21d4488.webm?t=1781620388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/5e5e9953ce9fc9889795bd4fb21d4488.mp4?t=1781620388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Crew</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new races and crew each with new unique abilities. Crew members now have 6 core stats, plus 4 resistance and skill stats which can be trained and leveled up to take on various specializations. Send your crew on new away missions to take down monsters on different planets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/0ed79d182bcc70cdbb312855c3b53ef9.poster.avif?t=1781620388\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/0ed79d182bcc70cdbb312855c3b53ef9.webm?t=1781620388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/0ed79d182bcc70cdbb312855c3b53ef9.mp4?t=1781620388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Tournament</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eSports tournaments are a big part of Pixel Starships. New league and tournament modes are coming soon. The tournament system is now split into amateur and professional leagues to suit differing level of play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/661735d30d2d6c3164f93562a911e92d.poster.avif?t=1781620388\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/661735d30d2d6c3164f93562a911e92d.webm?t=1781620388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/661735d30d2d6c3164f93562a911e92d.mp4?t=1781620388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will continue to post development updates on the steam page and forums. Please add the game to your wishlist to receive upcoming updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features - </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Build Epic Starships of your own design. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Many races, aliens, factions to command and conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Battle it out with other real players in a single massive online universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Manage diplomacy, recruitment, research, exploration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Control ship's power and limited resources. Discover epic weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Build and deploy support crafts to augment your Starship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Cross-section full ship control and battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Explore planets, discover the secrets of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Form alliances and battle with your friends to achieve victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Program situational AI commands for subsystems and crew. Allowing automatic combats and offline play. (from ship level 4 after building command room)</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Starships 2</strong> is a starship building and battle game in an MMO universe. Featuring full ship customization, online fleets, exploration, programmable AI, detailed planning, micro-management, and complex battle tactics. The strategy mechanics are inspired by games such as FTL, Eve online, and Final Fantasy, and XCom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/128762addcd1d98eadaec0d63d5b1a4d.poster.avif?t=1781620388\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/128762addcd1d98eadaec0d63d5b1a4d.webm?t=1781620388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154270/extras/128762addcd1d98eadaec0d63d5b1a4d.mp4?t=1781620388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in epic real-time or asynchronous battles in <i>Pixel Starships 2</i>, where you command your fully-customized starship in strategic PvP and PvE combat across the galaxy. Layout your crew, program advanced battle AI, and unleash devastating combos as you face off against players from around the world in intense tactical showdowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https: